/*
 * Tactical surviv.io bot client for TFAGaming/surviv.io
 *
 * Features:
 * - target selection, leading, weapon switching, strafing and retreating
 * - weighted loot search with inventory/gear awareness
 * - loot-crate detection and melee destruction
 * - bandage/medkit/soda/painkiller decisions with safety checks
 * - gas-circle rotation, door interaction, stuck recovery and team filtering
 * - real bot squads using shared match tokens, roles and a squad blackboard
 * - focus fire, rescue assignments, formation movement and loot reservations
 * - per-map tactical profiles plus runtime analysis of rivers, places and static objects
 * - bridge routing, cover-to-cover movement, event-map loot rules and Cobalt class selection
 * - full 50v50 faction command: front line, bridgeheads, flanks, medics, reserves and fire support
 * - cross-squad enemy sharing, distributed focus fire, large-force spacing and faction-wide rescue
 * - maximum-owned-scope visibility gating: no off-screen entity target lock
 * - bullet-entry trajectory inference, defensive turn and confidence-based counterfire
 * - all-weapon mastery scoring using damage, cadence, spread, range, speed and ammo state
 * - tactical use of explosive map objects and deliberate destruction of weak enemy cover
 * - roof, bush and smoke concealment: ambush use, last-seen tracking and area denial
 * - hidden-enemy flushing by bush destruction, roof-support attacks and controlled blind fire
 * - spatial-grid entity queries, throttled tactical scans and bounded ballistic memory
 * - team-bucketed 50v50 pruning for stable high-bot-count CPU and memory usage
 * - urgency-weighted ballistic reactions, high-DPS counterfire quickswitch and safe stop-to-shoot
 * - definition-driven falloff/obstacle multipliers, damaged-barrel priority and late-ring aggression
 * - faction bridge control, role-priority targeting and ring-edge rotation instead of blind center rushing
 * - Wiki-grounded loot-tier expected value, high-value resource points and spawn-aware opening routes
 * - staged gas-ring control, perk-aware combat, smoke-covered rescue and post-revive extraction
 * - controlled metal ricochet attempts, smoking-barrel kills and late-circle hard-cover positioning
 * - source-aware airdrop/bunker/cache/class-pod scoring with recent destroyed-container attribution
 * - phase-aware adrenaline management, safe soda/painkiller use and boost-driven movement commitment
 * - custom 1v1 duel intelligence: sandbag cover, breakable arena cover, no-loot rules and configurable adrenaline policy
 *
 * Run from server/:
 *   node -r ts-node/register src/smartBot.ts
 */

